The only dissapoinment was that there is no new character classes. This is one
amazing game. I love all the special levels. 

The OPENWINBUG did give me problems (namely, the two functions that were
withinh the #ifdef's were not resolved). The program compiled without this
ran both within openwin 2 and 3. The only problems I now have are that the
numberpad doesnot work with X11 (with the option set), and the special font
doesnot show the corridors. Moving with mouse is a pain and I've resorted
back to tty mode because of that. If some one out there could give me a hint
(other than get a life that is ;) I'd be eternally thankful.

The most fun I've had is watching all the stupid deaths of object using
monsters that was the sole domain of nethack player in V3.0.

.. the dwarf zaps the wand.. the missile hits you.. it is reflected from your
amulet.. the missile hits the dwarf. the dwarf is killed. "Bwahaha.."

On quests, I was given permission to find the "thingamabob" by the elder. How
on earth do you find the entrance to the start of the quest? I've searched the
entire "elders home" level but could not find any other portal except the one 
that I came through.

Most of the abuses ( polymorph, bag of holding, gold dumping pets) have been
fixed. So it is up to us to find new ones :)  

***SPOILERS ALERT *** may be minor


I've seen people talking about fort knox. I came across fort Ludios through 
a magic portal in a vault. Is this the same thing?

The most horrifying creature I met (so far) was the mind slayer. I'd love to 
have one of these as a pet. 

Once I piled about 20 scrolls and other misc. stuff and polymorphed it. The
result was one straw golem and other misc., stuff. All the spell books and
scrolls were gone. 

Writing on blank spellbooks require huge amounts of ink. "identify" took
43 charges out of my magic marker once. One interesting thing was when the
marker ran out of ink, the spell book was left "unfinished". Wonder I could 
recharge the marker and continue writing.

Rereading spellbooks makes them blank at a rate determined by the spell level.
The "identify" spellbook bacame blank only after 4 readings whereas "sleep"
spellbook is still readable after 12 readings.

What does a "slick cloak" do? Resist grabbing?
falling in to a moat causes all (almost) of scrolls, potions, books to become
blank. But I got saved once even when the teleport didn't work. 
I guess this is balanced by the new "amulet of magical breathing".

Wishing for named weapons is a bit risky. Once I asked for "magicbane" and got
just that. The real one was called "Magicbane". This can be verified via an id
scroll though. It says "the Magicbane" instead of "an athame called magicbane"
This is one cool weapon IMHO.

I was able to wish for and get rustproof weapons and identifying shows this
fact (rustproofness). 

Whats with the new medusa level. The only exit from the first room opens to a
moat. I guess you need levitation/water walking to get past that.

Thats all for now. I was hoping to finish my thesis this semester. It looks
like it ma take some more time.. 

